### 0. 회원가입
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "12345678",
  "name": "테스터"
}

### 1. 먼저 로그인해서 토큰 받기
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### 2. 나의 판매 포토카드 조회 (기본)
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2ZGY2NGQwYy1kNmVmLTQ3NDgtOWM4NS1hYTkwYWY1MzAzNmYiLCJpYXQiOjE3NjEyOTg1NjgsImV4cCI6MTc2MTM4NDk2OH0.Cf2hsvbDm6eBwOg-OpcaPOhKZZspu7LkhM3LpICTYhs
GET http://localhost:4000/api/my-photo-cards/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. 검색어로 필터링
GET http://localhost:4000/api/my-photo-cards/sales?search=카드이름
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 등급 필터링 (COMMON, RARE, SUPERRARE, LEGENDARY)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/my-photo-cards/sales?grade=rare
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 품절 상품만 조회
GET http://localhost:4000/api/my-photo-cards/sales?soldOut=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 여러 필터 조합
GET http://localhost:4000/api/my-photo-cards/sales?grade=rare&status=active&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}